CORE
main.c

^\[main\.assertion\.1\] .* reached: SUCCESS$
^\*\* 1 of \d+ failed
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
no body for callee
--
__CPROVER_cover and the must/may annotations have no body by design: they
are interpreted by --cover and by the must/may analyses, and do nothing
otherwise.  Each call was reported as a call to a function without a body.
